cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Classic Pattern Explorer in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Classic Pattern Explorer"
version: "3.3"
authors:
  - alias: "cobari"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cobari/CPE-release"
url: "https://cobari.github.io/CPE-release/"
abstract: >-
  Classic Pattern Explorer (CPE) is a digital humanities research tool for
  locating and examining sentence-pattern candidates in Literary Sinitic
  source texts across local UTF-8 libraries, 19 online historical and
  Buddhist databases, a command-line interface, and a local
  stdio MCP server.
keywords:
  - "Literary Sinitic"
  - "Classical Chinese"
  - "Digital Humanities"
  - "ITKC"
  - "CBETA"
  - "NDL OCR"
  - "Pattern Search"
  - "MCP"
